<p>As we start the new year, it is always interesting to see what people are using on the devices to get things done. On my Galaxy S24, I have a selection of apps that I use daily that help me with productivity, in remembering things, and in keeping this crazy little thing called life in order.</p>
<p>Let’s get into it.</p>
